* cforge testbench: {{ spec.name }} on rc_lowpass_1st
* All values SI base units. Generated - do not edit by hand.
{{ netlist }}
* --- stimulus -------------------------------------------------------------
Vin in 0 DC 0 AC 1
* --- analyses -------------------------------------------------------------
* .save is mandatory: in batch mode ngspice keeps no vectors without it, and
* .meas then silently has no data to work on.
.save v(in) v(out)
.ac dec {{ points_per_decade }} {{ f_start | spice }} {{ f_stop | spice }}
* --- measurements ----------------------------------------------------------
* fc_hz: the -3.01 dB corner, found by interpolation on the swept response.
.meas ac fc_hz WHEN vdb(out)=-3.01 FALL=1
* gain_db_passband: two decades below the corner, where the response is flat.
.meas ac gain_db_passband FIND vdb(out) AT={{ f_passband | spice }}
* atten_db_at_10fc: rejection one decade past the target corner.
.meas ac atten_db_at_10fc FIND vdb(out) AT={{ f_ten_fc | spice }}
.end
